ing its 22-Aug approved issue _(~0.6% of mcap)_.","**Velox Shipping and Logistics** — past-warrant conversion: allots 56,31,107 equity shares to five non-promoters on converting May-2026 warrants, receiving the **Rs 5.07 crore** 75% balance."],"m_and_a":["**AXISCADES Technologies** — step-down US subsidiary XIDA is to buy the business assets of San Jose-based ITSJ Group for **up to US$7.0 million (about Rs 67 crore)**, US$2.5 million cash at completion, subject to definitive agreements _(~0.8% of mcap)_.","**Tata Consultancy Services** — completes its acquisition of 100% of BBY Services India LLP, agreed on 1-Oct, which becomes a wholly owned subsidiary from today.","**POCL Enterprises** — NCLT Chennai orders shareholder and unsecured-creditor meetings on 27-Nov to approve amalgamating Planetfirst Green into the company; no new financial terms."],"capex_core":["**Vraj Iron and Steel** — receives fresh MoEF&CC Terms of Reference for its Raipur greenfield steel plant (0.9 MTPA pellet plant, DRI kilns, billets, rolling mill); an environmental step, no capex figure stated."],"business_updates":["**Results season** — 16 companies filed results / earnings-call material today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) — tracked in the Results tab, not itemised here.","**Tata Consultancy Services** — launches the Industrial Intelligence Foundry, a library of configurable AI agents and workflows for engineering and manufacturing clients; no financial figure disclosed."],"distress_risk":["**Delta Corp** — a CGST order on its Deltin Denzong casino (Jul-2017 to Mar-2022) raises differential GST of **Rs 1.64 crore and Rs 1.43 crore**, each with equal penalty plus interest; the company may appeal.","**E To E Transportation Infrastructure** — wins an arbitral award of **Rs 3.40 crore** plus interest against IRCON International over Katni–Singrauli track-linking work, payable within four months _(~0.6% of mcap, our arithmetic)_.","**Refex Industries** — CIT(Appeals) partly allows its AY2014-15 appeal, deleting a Rs 36.40 lakh depreciation disallowance and remanding the Rs 17.48 crore capital-gains addition for fresh assessment."],"credit_rating_changes":["**LEAP India** — India Ratings upgrades its bank-loan ratings one notch, to IND A+/Stable from IND A long-term and IND A1+ from IND A1 short-term, after IPO-funded debt prepayment."]},"theme_titles":{"order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","equity_allotments":"Equity allotments (new)","m_and_a":"M&A / restructuring","capex_core":"Capex (core / topline)","business_updates":"Business updates","distress_risk":"Distress & risk","credit_rating_changes":"Credit-rating changes"},"theme_rows":{"order_wins":[{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GRINFRA_15102026142558_Intimation_Fourwrd_MMLP_concession_agreement.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/PARTH_15102026130829_Cover_letter_Announcement_signed.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/52021e60-827c-4265-83dc-713ba6ac7897.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/ebba07e4-b5cf-495c-b7ec-0ae13ea5d324.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/LTI_15102026104557_Stockexchangeintimationoct15.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null}],"equity_allotments":[{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TEGA_15102026105407_Initmation_for_allotment_shares_sd.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/2c2bd202-890d-44a3-bc61-b8906e1bb7b4.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null}],"m_and_a":[{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/AXISCADES_15102026091042_PressRelease_15102026.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TCS_CORPCS_15102026133009_SEInt15102026.pdf","declared":true,"mcap"